<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja-JP"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="25871181"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="845152908"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Shine Days"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Girls Dead Monster"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Little Braver"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:56.293"><div begin="00:30.812" end="04:26.207"><p begin="00:30.812" end="00:32.663" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">昨日見た夢は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昨天的梦已经</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kino u mi ta yume wa mo wu</span></p><p begin="00:33.075" end="00:36.544" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">もう忘れてしまったけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘得一干二净了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wasu le te xi ma ta ke do</span></p><p begin="00:37.255" end="00:42.224" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">この鼓動はまだドキドキしてるよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是心还在怦怦的跳动啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko dou wa ma da do ki do ki xi te lu yo</span></p><p begin="00:43.529" end="00:47.729" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">ポケットにありったけのコインを詰<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把所有的硬币</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">po ke to ni a li ta ke no ko yi n o</span></p><p begin="00:47.729" end="00:49.005" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">め込んでみる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都塞到口袋里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cu me ko n de mi lu</span></p><p begin="00:49.544" end="00:54.662" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">踵を鳴らし狭い部屋を出よう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们踮着脚走出狭小的房间吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kakato o na la xi sema yi he ya o de yo wu</span></p><p begin="00:57.632" end="01:00.366" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">さあ走り抜けろ 昨日と今日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么  让我们坚持跑到底吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa a haxi li nu ke lo</span></p><p begin="01:00.889" end="01:03.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">まだ見ぬ未来へとGo!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和还没有见过的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da mi nu mi lai he to</span></p><p begin="01:03.904" end="01:06.807" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">革命を起こしにいこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kaku mei o o ko xi ni yi ko wu</span></p><p begin="01:07.031" end="01:09.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">夢を叶えにいこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">实现梦想吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yume o kana e ni yi ko wu</span></p><p begin="01:10.119" end="01:12.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">駆け出したらどこまでもいこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果是初出茅庐的人的话无论哪里都会去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke da xi ta la do ko ma de mo yi ko wu</span></p><p begin="01:13.147" end="01:16.918" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">アインシュタインの理論もぶっ壊し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使是爱因斯坦的理论也要破坏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a yi n xi yu ta yi n no li lun mo</span></p><p begin="01:17.050" end="01:19.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">て突き進もう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们往前冲吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bu kowa xi te cu ki susu mo wu</span></p><p begin="01:23.295" end="01:28.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">ある晴れた日に出会った旅人は言っ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在某个晴朗的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a lu ha le ta hi ni</span></p><p begin="01:28.288" end="01:29.051" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">た<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在前方只是荒芜的大地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no saki ni wa a le ta dai qi da ke to</span></p><p begin="01:29.331" end="01:34.368" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">この先には荒れた大地だけと<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no saki ni wa a le ta dai qi da ke to</span></p><p begin="01:35.394" end="01:41.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">そんなことよりこの泥だらけの靴を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比起那个事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n na ko to yo li ko no dolo da la ke no kucu o</span></p><p begin="01:41.539" end="01:46.511" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">洗ってやりたい ずっと一緒だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想洗干净这满是泥的鞋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ala te ya li ta yi</span></p><p begin="01:49.970" end="01:52.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">さあここからは自分との勝負<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么就从这里开始  即使是一个人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa a ko ko ka la wa ji bun to no xiyou bu</span></p><p begin="01:53.189" end="01:55.807" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">たとえ1人でもGrow!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要进行和自己的胜负</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta to e hi to li de mo</span></p><p begin="01:56.288" end="02:00.139" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">いつまでもKidsのままじゃお腹がす<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成长吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yi cu ma de mo Kidsno ma ma ji ya</span></p><p begin="02:00.169" end="02:01.753" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">いちゃうよ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肚子饿了哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o naka ga su yi qi ya wu yo !</span></p><p begin="02:02.006" end="02:04.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">できれば心のままに行こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果可以的话就随心去做吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de ki le ba kokolo no ma ma ni yi ko wu</span></p><p begin="02:05.372" end="02:08.057" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">大きな地図を描こう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">描绘大地图吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">oo ki na qi zu o ega ko wu</span></p><p begin="02:08.587" end="02:11.205" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">果てはあたしたち次第<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">最后我们会逐渐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha te wa a ta xi ta qi xi dai</span></p><p begin="02:11.568" end="02:13.588" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">無限大だよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">变得无限大哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu gen dai da yo</span></p><p begin="02:14.151" end="02:23.007" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">どんな日が来てもいつでもこの拳を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管什么样的日子来临</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na hi ga ki te mo yi cu de mo</span></p><p begin="02:23.007" end="02:25.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">かざして</p><p begin="02:26.343" end="02:27.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">I am sunshine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是一束阳光</span></p><p begin="02:28.540" end="02:35.016" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">雲の切れ間から差し込むよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会从云的缝隙中插入</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kumo no ki le ma ka la sa xi ko mu yo</span></p><p begin="02:35.016" end="02:40.874" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">柔らかなBeam!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">温柔的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yawa la ka na</span></p><p begin="03:15.756" end="03:20.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">置いてくよ クズな奴は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">放下吧  迟钝的家伙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o yi te ku yo gu zu na yacu wa</span></p><p begin="03:21.713" end="03:26.832" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">すぐそこに 勝機の予感<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那里马上后会有致胜的预感</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su gu so ko ni xiyou ki no yo kan</span></p><p begin="03:29.862" end="03:32.679" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">さあ走り抜けろ 昨日と今日<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么  让我们坚持跑到底  去往昨天和今天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa a haxi li nu ke lo kino u to kiyo u</span></p><p begin="03:33.066" end="03:35.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">まだ見ぬ未来へとGo!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">和还没有见过的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da mi nu mi lai he to</span></p><p begin="03:36.345" end="03:39.732" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">革命起こしにいくよ？ Are you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kaku mei o o ko xi ni yi ku yo ?</span></p><p begin="03:39.732" end="03:41.725" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">ready to go baby?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你准备好了吗  宝贝</span></p><p begin="03:41.881" end="03:44.966" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">決めたらもう迷わずに行くよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果决定了的话就会不在迷惑的走下去哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki me ta la mo wu mayo wa zu ni yi ku yo</span></p><p begin="03:45.548" end="03:49.183" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">アインシュタインの理論もぶっ壊し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使是爱因斯坦的理论也要破坏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a yi n xi yu ta yi n no li lun mo</span></p><p begin="03:49.193" end="03:51.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">て突き進む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们往前冲吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bu kowa xi te cu ki susu mu</span></p><p begin="03:51.610" end="03:54.664" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">あたしたちはみんな Dazzling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是大家的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta xi ta qi wa mi n na</span></p><p begin="03:54.664" end="03:57.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">sunshine いこう Monster sun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">耀眼的阳光</span></p><p begin="03:57.557" end="03:58.179" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">shine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吞食</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yi ko wu</span></p><p begin="03:59.400" end="04:05.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">喰ってかかってやるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">巨大的阳光吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku te ka ka te ya lu n da</span></p><p begin="04:06.051" end="04:07.817" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">we are sunshine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们是阳光</span></p><p begin="04:08.530" end="04:12.697" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">雲の切れ間から射す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从云彩的缝隙中照射出</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kumo no ki le ma ka la sa su</span></p><p begin="04:14.237" end="04:26.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">夢を叶える光 Shine Days<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">实现梦想的光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yume o kana e lu hikali</span></p></div></body></tt>